{
 "brief": "Israeli occupation forces targeted a health center in Jabalya, northern Gaza, Shehab Wire reported. The Al-Awda Health and Community Society condemned the repeated and deliberate strikes against the Al-Awda Health and Community Center in the Halawa area of Jabalya al-Balad, stating the attack occurred as a United Nations delegation was present in the territory.\n\nThe society characterized the strikes as part of a pattern of intentional targeting of the facility in the Gaza Strip's north.",
